  "intro": {
    "text": "`-(y)lA` means with or by: *annemle* (with my mother), *otobüsle* (by bus), *arabayla* (by car). *İçin* means for: *Ayşe için*. With pronouns both take the genitive: *benimle* (with me), *senin için* (for you).",
    "see": "gp-ile"
  },
